:{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attendance number: 27"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Date of Birth: May 10, 1988."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyazaki Nodoka is student number 27 in the class at Mahora Academy. She is a shy bookworm, who spends most of her time in the library or the bookstore. She is among the top ranking students in the school, and she possesses knowledge of a wide variety of topics from her constant reading. She often uses her hair to cover her eyes completely, but when brought out of her shy shell, gains confidence, and shows one of her eyes. Although Negi is several years younger than her, she still has a crush on him because she believes he carries the maturity of an adult. She is also very close to Yue, and after learning of Yue's feelings for Negi and her distress of having the same crush as her friend, Nodoka comforts her, although she still has normal jealousy on occasion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25381"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b70750b4f87f32820399fe4cc36f9fde33fbfc791fff3c3821368a611882066c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afa344a97685db04bc45b0facc1f8030375f08d9e904ce7f159fb9b8e2ccc9d4.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"能登 麻美子","creatorId":"vndb:s468","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s468","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s468","name":"能登 麻美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16746","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c25382","characterName":"神楽坂 明日菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c25382"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽坂 明日菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"421"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attendance number: 8."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Date of Birth: April 21, 1988."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Club activities: Fine Arts, \"Baka Ranger\" Baka Red."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Magic Effect: Complete nullification of other's magical ability (Magic Cancel)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kagurazaka Asuna is student number eight in Negi's class, and the lead female character. She is very short-tempered and quick to resort to violence (especially towards Negi), though she is very protective of those close to her. Asuna has a crush on her former home room teacher, Takahata, and she spends a significant amount of time attempting to become closer to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuna bonds with Negi after he becomes her teacher, though she is initially wary of him. While she claims to hate children, she is easily the closest in the class to Negi, which leads a number of her classmates believe the relationship is romantic, a claim that she repeatedly denies. Although she denies having feelings for Negi, it has been hinted throughout the story that she harbors some form of love towards him, though it may just be brotherly, it has not been explicitly expressed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia."}],